  <name>Ri-li</name>
  <summary>Kidsgame, drive a toy wood engine</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
     You drive a toy wood engine in many levels and you must collect all
     the coaches to win. Full-featured: Colorful animated wood engine,
     50 levels, 3 beautiful music tracks and many sound effects.
    </p>
    <p>
     Ri-li is translated in 19 languages: Arabic, Breton, Chinese, Dutch,
     English, Esperanto, French, German, Hungarian, Italian, Japanese,
     Korean, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Slovak, Spanish, Swedish and Turkish.
    </p>
  </description>
